{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS09247-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>天文台表示，本港風勢將會增強。晚上8時10分，政府已通知返家路程偏遠嘅員工下班，並提醒路程偏遠、轉折或居住離島嘅市民，應啟程回家。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS09332-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS09142-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS09314-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS08815-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS08543-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS08565-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS08605-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7153-1-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>周六下午，三號強風信號已生效，紅霞先聲奪人，下午四時許，天色變壞，開始有風雨。在荔枝角長沙灣道750號一個地盤，一幅巨型棚架喺風雨中畀吹倒，約五層樓高嘅棚架向下傾倒，部分棚架倒向附近嘅一座工廈天台。消防派出災難應變救援車同救護車到場，在場警員戴上頭盔，喺附近巴士站維持秩序，初步無人受傷。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_8433-768x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7138-2-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7071-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7101-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_8399-1024x768.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7056-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7127-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>打風期間，有市民喺九龍城街市購買蔬菜、牛肉等，檔口大排長龍。喺一個建築地盤，工人約喺下午二時許，離開天秤返回安全位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6804-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6789-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6850-1024x684.jpeg\"/>\n<p>天文台今午表示，下午四時，颱風紅霞集結喺香港東南偏東約250公里，時速約18公里，預料向西北移動，大致移向廣東東部沿岸。天文台會視乎紅霞嘅登陸地點與香港距離、烈風區大小，以及本地風力情況，評估是否需要喺今晚9時至午夜12時之間，改發更高熱帶氣旋警告信號。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6856-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6983-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6859-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T15:58:02.991190+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":23,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}